ower for financial behaviors or credit card approvals. Removing it reduces noise without harming model performance.\nend\n\npython\n# Explanation why the column DriversLicense is dropped\ndf.drop(columns=['DriversLicense'], inplace=True)\n# Usefulness: Possessing a driver’s license provides little information about financial responsibility or creditworthiness, making it irrelevant for this task.\nend"]###,
